@startuml
title Service order decomposition fallout - Order fallout detection

participant "Event\nManagement" as Event #grey
participant "Service Order\nManagement" as SOM #blue

SOM -> SOM : 1 //<color:red>Build **resource order items**</color>//\nThe decomposition of the 4G Mobile Line RFSs in Resources fails
activate SOM

SOM -> SOM : 2 Mobile Line serviceOrderItem and serviceOrder (state="Held")

SOM -> Event : 3 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST event serviceOrderStateChange\n(serviceOrderItemState="Held",\nserviceceOrderState="Held")
activate Event
Event --> SOM : 4 **TMF688** 201 Created
deactivate Event

SOM -> Event : 5 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST event serviceOrderException
activate Event
Event --> SOM : 6 **TMF688** 201 Created
deactivate Event
deactivate SOM

@enduml
